<hr data-start=3D"11902" data-end=3D"11905">
<h2 data-start=3D"11907" data-end=3D"11920">Next moves</h2>
<p data-start=3D"11922" data-end=3D"11934">Once you=E2=80=99ve:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"11936" data-end=3D"12018">
<li data-start=3D"11936" data-end=3D"11980">
<p data-start=3D"11939" data-end=3D"11980">Prepared <code data-start=3D"119=
48" data-end=3D"11968">age_data/train.csv</code> + <code data-start=3D"1197=
1" data-end=3D"11980">val.csv</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"11981" data-end=3D"12001">
<p data-start=3D"11984" data-end=3D"12001">Trained the model</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"12002" data-end=3D"12018">
<p data-start=3D"12005" data-end=3D"12018">Exported ONNX</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"12020" data-end=3D"12045">=E2=80=A6we can do the next step=
:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"12047" data-end=3D"12225">
<li data-start=3D"12047" data-end=3D"12149">
<p data-start=3D"12049" data-end=3D"12149">integrate with <code data-start=
=3D"12064" data-end=3D"12070">ezkl</code> (<code data-start=3D"12072" data-=
end=3D"12086">gen-settings</code>, <code data-start=3D"12088" data-end=3D"1=
2101">gen-witness</code>, <code data-start=3D"12103" data-end=3D"12120">com=
pile-circuit</code>, <code data-start=3D"12122" data-end=3D"12129">setup</c=
ode>, <code data-start=3D"12131" data-end=3D"12138">prove</code>, <code dat=
a-start=3D"12140" data-end=3D"12148">verify</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"12150" data-end=3D"12225">
<p data-start=3D"12152" data-end=3D"12225">wire that circuit into the actua=
l subnet-2 miner so validators accept it.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"12227" data-end=3D"12252">When you=E2=80=99re ready, paste=
